  "summary": "Pipeline-coverage data slide (1920x1080, 16:9) accepted by visual review (score/confidence 0.85). Clean typographic layout, no imagery (deliberate \u2014 data belongs on type). Hierarchy: 4.2x (128px teal #155E75) dominant > $18M quota target (64px) mid-tier > four stage tiles (40px values) subordinate. Header kicker + FY QUOTA REVIEW context in teal #0891B2; single supporting takeaway line. Four equal 410x136 rounded tiles (rx12, 1px #E5E7EB border, teal #0F766E top rule) at even 450px pitch: Discovery $24.8M, Qualification $21.4M, Proposal $17.9M, Negotiation $11.5M; source caption footer. Brand: platform default, single teal accent, Inter, white bg. Repair loop resolved three prior issues (hero dead zone, hero pairing, inconsistent tile borders) plus a regression where a strokes.set on stage_2 cleared its computed geometry (LUME0201 zero-size render) \u2014 fixed by re-running preflight to re-solve layout before export, then applying stage_3's missing border and re-exporting the full SVG+PNG bundle. Only benign advisories remain (LUME0205/0210 hug-sizing/inside-stroke notes; LUMB0613/0614 font embed/subset export warnings). Final preview valid at 1920x1080.",
